    "descricao": "Prepare to apply Everything you need to know to understand if you can apply, check if your research is right for Wellcome, write your application and prepare for interview. Can you and your organisation apply? Is your research right for Wellcome? Write your application and prepare for interview How to use the Wellcome Funding platform These set out the terms and conditions on which we award grants. Applicants and organisations must comply with our grant conditions, along with our funding policies and any terms and conditions set out in their award letter. Eligibility information for applicants and organisations applying for Wellcome funding. Some of our funding is open to applicants based in low- or middle-income countries. Review a list of countries with low-income or middle-income economies, compiled by the Organisation for Ecomonomic Co-operation and Development. Why we don't support researchers funded by the tobacco industry. Who our policy applies to and what researchers and organisations must do. Wellcome cannot fund activities in mainland China because of the Chinese Overseas Non-governmental Organisation (NGO) Law. The career stage and experience expected of early-career researchers, and the funding opportunities Wellcome has available for researchers at this career stage.",
